00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:04.820
Was a very wide intersection. We had just come over like the little bridge,

00:15:05.325 --> 00:15:07.325
and there was a very wide intersection

00:15:07.325 --> 00:15:11.565
and as you we came over to the right went up a hill.

00:15:12.845 --> 00:15:14.045
But it's just.

00:15:14.365 --> 00:15:21.500
You know, there are things that can be done to tighten that intersection up so that people aren't making sweeping turns,

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.340
so that pedestrians

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:26.460
have a better place to walk and to cross.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:29.740
You know, it's

00:15:30.395 --> 00:15:31.355
unreasonable

00:15:31.355 --> 00:15:33.115
to assume that

00:15:33.275 --> 00:15:36.715
