00:15:37.035 --> 00:15:38.555
I think that's probably

00:15:39.355 --> 00:15:43.435
not a necessary thing, but providing some

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:54.110
you know, calming of the traffic and better striping and better guidance for drivers and pedestrians, I think, would help through that area.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:00.350
We also talked about an another intersection

00:16:00.015 --> 00:16:01.775
that's a smaller intersection,

00:16:02.575 --> 00:16:03.935
the potential for

00:16:05.135 --> 00:16:06.495
a very small

00:16:07.295 --> 00:16:09.535
kind of neighborhood traffic circle.

