I think I even gave Eric at some point a little

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:16.390
very rough

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:20.310
draft of what that could look like. And all of these things,

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:21.350
you know,

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:26.790
there are chicanes on one of the streets, but the chicanes, the the traffic circle,

00:16:28.235 --> 00:16:31.435
all of these things, even the striping, I mean, nothing is

00:16:32.075 --> 00:16:39.035
set in stone. Right? You can try out you can try chicanes on a temporary basis. You can try traffic circle on a temporary basis

00:16:39.355 --> 00:16:39.595
and

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:45.650
tweak it or decide it's not working. Get public input. Maybe people don't like it.

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:48.610
You know, even the striping, I mean,

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:55.010
it it only lasts as long as it lasts. So if you if you strike the edge lines and you decide it's just not working,

00:16:56.935 --> 00:16:59.175
as they fade out, you do something different.

00:17:00.215 --> 00:17:02.375
But that's the general

00:17:03.815 --> 00:17:06.055
review that we did. Okay.

