00:19:43.715 --> 00:19:48.035
cones. I mean there's some different ways you could do it on a temporary basis for a trial run,

00:19:48.515 --> 00:19:49.955
but normally a permanent

00:19:50.195 --> 00:19:52.515
construction is curbing and

00:19:52.675 --> 00:19:54.675
landscaping on the extension.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:20:06.810
>> What do you think of the one thing I didn't hear you mention is what do you think of like the road speed bumps to slow people down? I mean, I've seen them in Coventry. I've seen them over like

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:11.975
around the university where you work on some of the side roads that get some heavy traffic.

00:20:12.295 --> 00:20:14.455
